Package: fastkcv
Title: Fast Exact Cross-Validation for Global Kriging
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Nicholas", "Taylor", , "nicholasclevelandtaylor@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fast, exact leave-one-out, k-fold and buffered leave-one-out
    cross-validation for global (unique neighborhood) simple, ordinary
    and universal kriging, computed from a single factorization of the
    covariance matrix (Dubrule (1983) <doi:10.1007/BF01033232>; Ginsbourger
    and Schärer (2024) <doi:10.1080/10618600.2024.2353633>). Takes the
    same inputs as 'gstat' krige.cv() and reproduces its output to
    numerical precision, with nugget effects, nested and anisotropic
    variogram models. Includes random, spatial block and k-means fold
    builders and summary statistics for comparing fold designs.
